        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>DatabaseConnectionPool</name>
        <qualifiedname>DatabaseConnectionPool::DatabaseConnectionPool</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Builds the pool from the <ref refid="classConfigurator" kindref="compound">Configurator</ref>, creating all connections up front. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Initialises the pool from the <ref refid="classConfigurator" kindref="compound">Configurator</ref>; failure terminates the process.</para>
<para>Reads the acquire timeout and <computeroutput>DB_MAX_CONN</computeroutput>, warns if the pool is smaller than <computeroutput>SERVER_THREADS + 1</computeroutput>, then creates connections concurrently with bounded retries and exponential backoff. Any creation failure is fatal (process exit).</para>
<para>Reads DB_MAX_CONN and the acquire timeout, warns when the pool is undersized, then starts all connections concurrently. Each slot retries with exponential backoff (MAX_RETRIES attempts); if any slot cannot be created, a runtime_error is raised and the catch block exits the process with EXIT_FAILURE. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
